# Grandfathered legacy files for scripts/forbid_fixed_wait.sh
#
# These test files carry fixed-duration pump/pumpAndSettle waits written
# BEFORE the fixed-wait gate existed. They are frozen here so the gate is
# GREEN today while still blocking NEW fixed sleeps in every other (and every
# freshly-authored) test file. This is a RATCHET: when one of these files is
# next meaningfully edited, convert its pump(const Duration(...)) calls to
# pump-until-condition (pumpUntilFound) and DELETE its line here. The baseline
# only ever shrinks. One repo-relative path per line.
#
# Generated 2026-06-24 from the then-current corpus.
